{"quest":{"line_id":"16010511","line_type":"5","order":850,"title":{"cn":"新入职的信使","en":"New Messenger","jp":"新任メッセンジャー","kr":"신입 메신저"},"description":{"cn":"你帮助了落难的新信使，让信使可以将来自莱希拉姆的牵挂送往伊索米亚各地。","en":"Thanks to your help, the stranded new messenger was able to continue delivering the Lyceum's messages of concern across Esperia.","jp":"あなたは困難に直面する新任メッセンジャーを助け、レヒラムからの想いをエスペリア各地へ届けられるようにした。","kr":"곤경에 처한 메신저를 도와준 덕분에, 메신저는 라이세움의 소식을 에스페리아 곳곳으로 전할 수 있게 되었다."},"reputation_camp_id":"602","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"莱希拉姆魔法学校","en":"Serene Lyceum","jp":"レヒラム魔法学院","kr":"라이세움 마법 아카데미"},"route":"#/season-6/daily/16010511","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010511:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233010"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233020"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010511:1:2"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010511:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233030"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010511:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233040"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010511:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233050"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010511:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233060"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010511:1:7"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233070"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010511:1:8"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233080"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010511:1:9"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233090"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与佐尔娅对话","en":"Talk to Zorya","jp":"ザレリヤと話す","kr":"조르아와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"闲来无事，去看看佐尔娅老师那里有没有什么需要帮忙的吧。","en":"Since you're free for now, go see if Zorya needs help with anything.","jp":"時間ができたので、ザレリヤに何か手伝えることがないか聞いてみよう。","kr":"한가한 김에 조르아 쪽에 도움이 필요한 일이 있는지 확인해 보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"使用变形术","en":"Transform","jp":"変身魔法を使う","kr":"변신술 사용"},"objective_description":{"cn":"使用变形术追踪新信使的羽毛上的气息。","en":"Use transfiguration to track the scent on the new messenger's feather.","jp":"変身魔法を使って、新任メッセンジャーの羽根に残る気配を追跡しよう。","kr":"변신술을 사용해 메신저의 깃털에 남은 기운을 추적하자."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"追踪信使","en":"Track the Messenger","jp":"メッセンジャーを追う","kr":"메신저 추적하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"循着羽毛上的气息追踪信使。","en":"Follow the scent on the feather and track down the messenger.","jp":"羽根に残された気配をたどり、メッセンジャーを追跡しよう。","kr":"깃털에 남은 기운을 따라 메신저를 추적하자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"继续追踪信使","en":"Keep Tracking","jp":"追跡を続ける","kr":"계속 메신저 추적하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"气息越来越近了，信使或许就在不远处。","en":"The scent is getting stronger. The messenger should be nearby.","jp":"気配がますます濃くなってきた。おそらくメッセンジャーはすぐ近くにいる。","kr":"기운이 점점 가까워지고 있다. 메신저는 아마 멀지 않은 곳에 있을 것이다."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与信使对话","en":"Talk to Messenger","jp":"メッセンジャーと話す","kr":"메신저와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"你找到了信使。上前与其沟通，看看信使的情况。","en":"You find the messenger. Go talk to it and see what happened.","jp":"メッセンジャーを発見した。話しかけて、状況を確認しよう。","kr":"메신저를 찾았다. 다가가서 상황을 확인해 보자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"寻找丢失的信件","en":"Find the Lost Letter","jp":"手紙を探す","kr":"메신저가 잃어버린 편지 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"寻找信使丢失的信件。","en":"Look for the letter the messenger lost.","jp":"メッセンジャーがなくした手紙を探してあげよう。","kr":"메신저가 잃어버린 편지를 찾아보자."}},{"step_id":"7","pre_step_ids":["6"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与信使对话","en":"Talk to Messenger","jp":"メッセンジャーと話す","kr":"메신저와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"回去将信件交给信使。","en":"Take the letter back to the messenger.","jp":"手紙をメッセンジャーのもとへ持ち帰ろう。","kr":"돌아가 메신저에게 편지를 건네주자."}},{"step_id":"8","pre_step_ids":["7"],"objective_title":{"cn":"整理邮包","en":"Sort the Mailbag","jp":"郵便カバンを整理する","kr":"우편 가방 정리하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"信使请求你帮它整理一下邮包。","en":"The messenger asks you to help sort its mailbag.","jp":"メッセンジャーから、郵便カバンの整理を手伝ってほしいと頼まれた。","kr":"메신저가 우편 가방을 정리해 달라고 부탁했다."}},{"step_id":"9","pre_step_ids":["8"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与佐尔娅对话","en":"Talk to Zorya","jp":"ザレリヤと話す","kr":"조르아와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"事情解决了。回去将这个好消息告诉佐尔娅吧。","en":"Everything is taken care of. Go back and tell Zorya the good news.","jp":"問題は解決した。この朗報をザレリヤに伝えに戻ろう。","kr":"일이 해결되었다. 이 소식을 조르아에게 전하러 가자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"16233010","asset":"ep6/quest_story_16233010","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep6/quest_story_16233010.asset","raw_sha256":"015d3ef135dbd860ae60296ab7cd67b68be6cfa2e8c442ed2be742308b0c1bb2","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":30815392,"size":1856,"identity":"16010511:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"16233020","asset":"ep6/quest_story_16233020","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep6/quest_story_16233020.asset","raw_sha256":"7330bf070c720fd0f1e424ea37ae6fe10359317bc597e7e2dd22d75657429ac7","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":30817248,"size":1032,"identity":"16010511:1:1","field":"FinishAction"},{"plot":"16233030","asset":"ep6/quest_story_16233030","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep6/quest_story_16233030.asset","raw_sha256":"4a37669ffa9619d4867f07e3d4112b17b37163b76054e2bcde8cd2c9c7406bfb","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":30818280,"size":1016,"identity":"16010511:1:3","field":"ClientFinishActionByMove"},{"plot":"16233040","asset":"ep6/quest_story_16233040","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep6/quest_story_16233040.asset","raw_sha256":"8702a75d4c0f2e55a15b5d0286108a13f586964abf20adf8d2241ee0bcc20aa4","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":30819296,"size":1064,"identity":"16010511:1:4","field":"ClientFinishActionByMove"},{"plot":"16233050","asset":"ep6/quest_story_16233050","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep6/quest_story_16233050.asset",